---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import MandalaWatermark from '../components/motifs/MandalaWatermark.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Us — PanchangPath"
  description="PanchangPath — a free Hindu Panchang and Jyotish site built by a student, using real astronomical calculations (Drik method, Lahiri Ayanamsha)."
>
  <!-- Hero: eyebrow + headline + subhead (same shape as /faq's hero) -->
  <section style="background:var(--color-canvas);border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-hairline);padding:48px 0 40px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;">
    <div class="gradient-mesh" style="position:absolute;inset:0;opacity:0.5;pointer-events:none;"></div>
    <MandalaWatermark size={480} opacity={0.06} />
    <div class="container" style="position:relative;max-width:820px;">
      <p class="caption-mono" style="color:var(--color-mute);margin:0 0 8px;">ABOUT</p>
      <h1 style="font-size:34px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-1.4px;line-height:1.15;color:var(--color-ink);margin:0 0 12px;">Built for accuracy, not shortcuts.</h1>
      <p style="font-size:16px;color:var(--color-body-text);margin:0;max-width:680px;line-height:1.6;">PanchangPath is a free Hindu Panchang and Jyotish site that calculates Tithi, Nakshatra, Muhurta timings, Kundali charts, and daily horoscopes using real astronomical positions — no signup, no paywall, no shortcuts.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- About this project -->
  <section style="padding:40px 0 64px;">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:820px;">
      <div class="card ab-card">
        <div class="ab-head">
          <span class="ab-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M22 10L12 5 2 10l10 5 10-5z"/>
              <path d="M6 12.2V17c3.2 2.8 8.8 2.8 12 0v-4.8"/>
              <path d="M22 10v6"/>
            </svg>
          </span>
          <h2 class="ab-heading">About this project</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="ab-body">
          <p>PanchangPath is built and maintained by a university student studying Computer Science and Engineering, with an interest in Vedic astrology, Sanskrit texts, and Indian calendrical astronomy. The project started as a way to make accurate Panchang calculations — based on real astronomical positions (the Drik method with Lahiri Ayanamsha) rather than the older, simplified almanac shortcuts many Panchang sites still rely on — freely available to anyone who needs them, after finding that most existing Panchang sites either used outdated calculation methods, covered only a single regional tradition, or offered no Hindi-language support at all. It has grown into a full Hindu Panchang and Jyotish resource.</p>
          <p>The site covers five areas: a daily Panchang calculator using real astronomical positions rather than simplified lookup tables, Muhurta tools for auspicious timing (Choghadiya, Rahu Kalam, and more), Jyotish calculators including Kundali generation and horoscope compatibility matching, a Rashifal horoscope section, and a devotional text library of Aarti, Chalisa, Stotram, and related scriptures — all available in both English and Hindi, and spanning 11 regional Panchang traditions alongside the standard Drik-Lahiri calculation. Rashifal predictions are drawn from a small set of pre-written entries rather than a true birth-chart calculation, and this is stated clearly on that page rather than left implied.</p>
          <p>Where a feature has real limitations — for instance, Panchang calculations are pinned to 6:00 AM local time rather than the day's actual sunrise, which can occasionally shift a Nakshatra Pada by one at the sunrise boundary — that's noted directly on the relevant page rather than left implied. Devotional texts are sourced from established published references rather than generated or invented, and calculation logic is checked against independent Panchang references during development.</p>
          <p>This is an independent, solo-built project and is not affiliated with any religious organization, temple, or publishing house. Nothing on this site constitutes religious or professional astrological guidance.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .ab-card { padding: 28px 32px 24px; }
  .ab-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    padding-bottom: 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-hairline);
  }
  .ab-icon {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 38px;
    height: 38px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: var(--color-saffron-soft);
    color: var(--color-saffron-deep);
  }
  .ab-heading {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    margin: 0;
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .ab-body { font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--color-body-text); }
  .ab-body p { margin: 0 0 16px; }
  .ab-body p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .ab-card { padding: 22px 20px 20px; }
    .ab-heading { font-size: 18px; }
    .ab-body { font-size: 15px; }
  }
</style>
